            </note>
            <note corresp="#d213-f2" n="14" xml:id="d213-f2-content">
                <p>See statement by the Secretary of State, July 16, 1937, and Department of State
                    press release, August 23, 1937, <ref target="frus1931-41v01#pg_325">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 325</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus1931-41v01#pg_355">355</ref>, respectively.</p>
            </note>
